This project uses card data and card images from the following sources:

MTGJSON (https://mtgjson.com/)
Licensed under the MIT License
Card metadata including names, mana costs, types, oracle text, and other
game-relevant fields is sourced from MTGJSON's open data sets.

Scryfall (https://scryfall.com/)
Card images and local-language printing data. Card images are not redistributed
by this project; they are fetched from Scryfall's CDN by the user's browser at
runtime. The per-locale card-art maps under client/public/ are derived from
Scryfall's bulk data sets.

magic-cards-zhs (https://github.com/HeliumOctahelide/magic-cards-zhs)
Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
(CC BY-SA 4.0) — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
Simplified-Chinese card names, type lines, and rules text are sourced from this
project's weekly data exports and compiled into the card-data.zh.json content
sidecar. The translated text is a derivative work of that data set and is
distributed under the same license. See THIRD-PARTY-CONTENT below.

mtgch.com / 大学院废墟 (https://mtgch.com/)
Simplified-Chinese card images. No license is published by this site; it states
that its database and card images are open to all developers and that it
operates under the Wizards of the Coast Fan Content Policy. Card images are not
redistributed by this project; they are fetched from its CDN by the user's
browser at runtime, and only when the user selects the Chinese card-art source.

